{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version offers approximately 60 minutes of gameplay, allowing players to get familiar with the basic controls and unique features. The full version will include more levels and a variety of gameplay mechanics combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;No Death in Wild West&quot; is a fast-paced action game where you engage in parkour and melee combat. Dodge bullets as you slam and slash your way through enemies in this thrilling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Grim Reaper, fighting the Reaper Raiders, a cowboy gang that is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/2e440429f3665aa346703ea84a3707a3.poster.avif?t=1757939096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/2e440429f3665aa346703ea84a3707a3.webm?t=1757939096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/2e440429f3665aa346703ea84a3707a3.mp4?t=1757939096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash, Slash &amp; Refresh</strong>: Kill and absorb enemy souls to refresh your dash!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slam &amp; Climb</strong>: Use spectral movement to quickly navigate the map.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set Records</strong>: Achieve your fastest time in sandbox-style levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard Glory</strong>: Post your score and compete with players worldwide.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Items</strong>: Scattered Soul, Jump Bombs, and Soul Fire, interact with unique in-game items.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Levels</strong>: Capture checkpoints, eliminate as many enemies as you can, face epic bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich Cutscenes</strong>: Explore a post-apocalyptic world after \u201cThe Second Great Flood.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Locations</strong>: Travel through varied environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/fde3fc8288485307b5760fba08e064fb.poster.avif?t=1757939096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/fde3fc8288485307b5760fba08e064fb.webm?t=1757939096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/extras/fde3fc8288485307b5760fba08e064fb.mp4?t=1757939096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781570?t=1757939096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781570?t=1757939096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/ba8b25c00763b565bae157c6b1e67b2f74366d46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757939096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/ba8b25c00763b565bae157c6b1e67b2f74366d46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757939096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Sa